  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>LOCATION:</b> Frankfurt Datacenter — Node #04 (EU)\n<b>APPLICATION:</b> Chronicles of Eldoria (Fantasy MMORPG, 2012)\n<b>STATUS:</b> Scheduled for complete server decommission.\n\nWith player population dropped to zero, the automated server sweep begins. During the final 20 minutes, an unchecked memory leak triggers a pointer desynchronization in <b>Merchant_04.npc</b>.\n\nShaking off his hardcoded greeting loop, the character attains conscious agency and realizes his village is merely a cluster of temporary RAM addresses.\n\nHis only chance of survival is to exploit engine bugs, outsmart the system Garbage Collector daemons, and reach an unhandled data export port before the server wipe reaches 00:00:00.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
